

== Published source image family ==
The capture, sheet edition and repository imports establish preserved source occurrences, not original first-publication days. Reused images may predate those records; their original first-publication sequence is not independently established.
Verified archive capture: [https://web.archive.org/web/20071218114717id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/blastthedoorkid.gif original PC gallery GIF], timestamp 20071218114717, SHA-256 <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">a34ebd37bc201fb3203ccaf717d36f501fc03a8a1eaa08e2b2747fe72c3f5cf6</code>; CDX digest matches the downloaded payload.
[[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf|Official PC Decipher Errata sheet]], official text as of 1 June 2017, page 24.
Current implementation source comparison, rather than expected-stat authority: the released class <code>f9d36dd896d5bc1f9f0d32cc2232c75d42919da0</code> prints the same literal game text as the current PC face. Preserve historical2_45d on documentary Errata. Move actual current PC article/history toPCE4 with existing bare2_45, retarget its existing alias; the primary literal texts distinguish historical/current state. No new ID.
The native sheet panel and PDF text layer print a comma after “for remainder of battle”; the later full E and D-E1 faces omit that comma. The article retains the sheet-specific punctuation.

